    story: Marie Ghostshard was born into an old master household, where old forms
      and old debts were treated as inheritance. As a child, Marie Ghostshard lived
      through a knife thrower assistant, learning masks, timing, falls, applause,
      and public courage. As a young adult, Marie Ghostshard worked through a bank
      wagon escort, turning caravan routes and roadside fights into a working education.
      They enter the dojo to earn more than a season of escort work.
